Role: Java Developer
Location: Alpharetta, GA.
Job type: Contract

Position Requirements
Minimum 5+ years experience in the software industry(For Mid level) and 2-3 years for Junior
Bachelor's degree in computer science, information technology, engineering or related field (willing to accept foreign education equivalent).
Java / J2EE design and development experience using Spring, JMS, JNDI, XML, XSLT, RMI, JSP,  JDBC, JUnit, AJAX.  Architectural experience – UML and OO design.
